$DIR/test.p:3:9: cannot slice unaddressable value [...]int{…} (value of type [3]int)
    This error occurs when a slice operation is applied to a value whose type is
    not sliceable, or is unaddressable.
    (see "Slice expressions" in the Plutonium spec, section 11.12)
    (run "pluto explain E0054" for a longer explanation)
